cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "The plane (72,108) Jacobian case — verified reduction"
abstract: >-
  A verified reduction program for the last open plane Jacobian-Conjecture case
  below degree 125 (the GGV-Horruitiner (8,28)/(72,108) case, arXiv:2204.14178,
  Prop 4.3), together with an independent exact re-verification of the
  dimension-3 Jacobian counterexample. Includes the f37-branch resultant-artifact
  closure (ideal-membership certificate) and a machine-generated live frontier,
  every claim catalogued with its checker and trust tier.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Strinz"
    given-names: "Will"
keywords:
  - "Jacobian Conjecture"
  - "polynomial automorphisms"
  - "computer-assisted proof"
  - "Groebner bases"
